      143.23,
      329.83,
      455.29,
      377.3
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends section 3 of the Ports and Airports Development Levy Act,No. 18 of 2011 and the legal effect of the section as amended is to exempt any equipment,tools, materials, consumables to be used in the petroleum operationd conducted within oroutside Sri Lanka in or from a bonded facility for storage, fabrication, repairing, servicingor exportation, from the payment of Ports and Airports Development Levy.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
