  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.23,
      387.43,
      455.29,
      415.7
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3: This clause amends section 16 of the Ports and Airports Development Levy Act,No. 18 of 2011 and the legal effect of the section as amended is to extend the validationof Orders made under section 2 of Part I of the Finance Act, No. 11 of 2002.",
